# Optional local Ollama model. Leave unset for a fully offline deterministic demo.
# Set this in the server process environment before starting; .env files are not auto-loaded.
# DATAFENCE_LLM_MODEL=your-installed-local-model
# Configure the Ollama daemon itself with OLLAMA_NO_CLOUD=1 for local-only operation.

# Optional SenseNova. Only the fixed official HTTPS endpoint is used.
# Windows: scripts/configure_sensenova.py securely prompts for a key and writes
# current-user DPAPI ciphertext to ignored runtime/secrets/sensenova.dpapi.
# runtime/llm.json stores provider/model and daily local request/token limits.
# That project credential takes precedence over an ambient environment key.
# For portable deployments without that file, explicitly select the provider:
# DATAFENCE_LLM_PROVIDER=sensenova
# SENSENOVA_API_KEY=your-provider-key
# SENSENOVA_MODEL=sensenova-6.8-flash-lite
# API invocation does not train or fine-tune the provider's model.
